      "subject": "kube-client@4.2.0:safe-to-deploy",
      "rationale": "Whole-crate certification remains withheld because the optional HTTPS proxy connector can reuse cluster TLS roots and identity. OxiBelt does not enable kube-client's HTTP or SOCKS proxy features; deployment diagnostics rejects command-based kubeconfig credentials and performs read-only API calls, while otherwise honoring operator-selected kubeconfig TLS settings.",
