      "control": "cargo-vet",
      "subject": "web-transport-trait@0.3.7:safe-to-deploy",
      "rationale": "The generic RecvStream::read_buf default remains unsuitable for whole-crate certification. OxiBelt consumes the selected web-transport-quinn 0.11.12 receive stream through Tokio AsyncRead into initialized storage; retain an exact-version exception pending an upstream API redesign or dependency removal.",
